package consumer.sqlite

/// Minimal source so this project has a root package. Its reason to exist is
/// the `test/` package: this project depends on `standard-sqlite` but declares
/// none of the manifest entries that dependency does, so it exercises every way
/// a registration reaches a dependent —
///
///   * `[[project.component]]` — the sqlite component must be composed in
///     transitively (transitiveComponentTest.dove)
///   * `[[project.literal]]` — `sql"..."` must resolve here
///     (inheritedRegistrationsTest.dove)
///   * `[[project.macro]]` — `@derive(ToSqlValue)` and friends must resolve here
///     (inheritedRegistrationsTest.dove)
///
/// The three travel by three different mechanisms in the pipeline, so each
/// needs its own guard.
public function marker(): Unit = ()
